{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-1-e2","title":"毌丘俭遣王颀追位宫至肃慎南界","order":5498,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-1-e2","label":"正文 · 正始六年","text":"毌丘俭遣王颀追位宫至肃慎南界","evidence":["wgc-q0214","wgc-q0015"]},{"id":"wuhuan-a-8dcd05b3d35fe4a826c6","label":"正文","text":"魏又遣偏师致讨高句丽，穷追极远，逾乌丸、（骨）〔丸〕都，过沃沮，践肃慎之庭，东临大海","evidence":["wuhuan-q-916e9f026a339b175ccd"]},{"id":"wuhuan-a-f12806cbe7b8bf5ab50c","label":"正文","text":"王颀别遣追讨位宫，尽其东界","evidence":["wuhuan-q-467915cb77f46a679702"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0048","role":"遣王颀追击","evidence":["wgc-q0214","wgc-q0015"]},{"person":"wgc-p0014","role":"追位宫过沃沮至肃慎南界","evidence":["wgc-q0214","wgc-q0015"]},{"person":"wgc-p0012","role":"被追讨者","evidence":["wuhuan-q-467915cb77f46a679702"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"正始六年","precision":"year","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0214","wgc-q0015","wgc-q0213"],"year":245,"chronology":"wgc-y-1-e2","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wgc-q0015","basis":"逐项对读原行动及直接释年注，保留原季月，不沿用后续迁官。"}},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0214"}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0048","name":"毌丘俭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wgc-p0012","name":"位宫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wgc-p0014","name":"王颀","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0015","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-d69c99d640aab2056824","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖10〗，复征之，宫遂奔买沟〖11〗。俭遣玄菟太守王颀追之，﹝三﹞过沃沮千有余里〖12〗，至肃慎氏南界〖13〗；刻石纪功，刊丸都之山〖14〗，铭不耐之城〖15〗。诸所诛纳八千余口，论功受赏，侯者百余人。穿山溉灌，民赖其利。迁左将军，假节，监豫州诸军事，领豫州刺史。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0213","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-318a84ef00a413f1b539","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗六年：正始六年（公元 245 ）。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0